> radius sum(n,1,inf,n^(2n)*x^n/2^n)
power series sum(n, 1, inf, n^(2n)*x^n/2^n) in x
  center x = 0; coefficients a_n = n^(2n)/2^n of x^(n)
  radius of convergence R = 0 (ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> inf)
  converges only at x = 0
> radius sum(n,1,inf,(-x)^n/n)
power series sum(n, 1, inf, (-x)^n/n) in x
  center x = 0; coefficients a_n = 1/n of -x^(n)
  radius of convergence R = 1 (ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> 1)
  at x = -1: diverges (limit comparison with the harmonic series sum 1/n (p = 1): a_n n -> 1)
  at x = 1: converges conditionally (alternating series test (|a_n| decreases to 0); not absolutely: |a_n| ~ C/n (p <= 1))
  interval of convergence: (-1, 1]
  sum = -log(x + 1)    for |-x| < 1 (-log(1 - u))
> radius sum(n,1,inf,x^n/n^2)
power series sum(n, 1, inf, x^n/n^2) in x
  center x = 0; coefficients a_n = 1/n^2 of x^(n)
  radius of convergence R = 1 (ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> 1)
  at x = -1: converges absolutely (|a_n| ~ C/n^2: comparison with a p-series (p > 1))
  at x = 1: converges absolutely (p-series 1/n^2 with p = 2 > 1)
  interval of convergence: [-1, 1]
